    <node id="阿青">
      <data key="d0">阿青</data>
      <data key="d1">人物</data>
      <data key="d2">A young shepherd girl with extraordinary swordsmanship skills who uses a bamboo stick in combat.&lt;SEP&gt;A young woman who tends sheep and demonstrates an innate talent in swordsmanship.&lt;SEP&gt;天真美丽的乡下姑娘，受白公公教导并与范蠡同牧羊&lt;SEP&gt;武艺高强、使用竹棒斗剑，范蠡的爱宠&lt;SEP&gt;神秘女子，通过呼喊威胁杀西施，暗中钟情于范蠡&lt;SEP&gt;被称为“阿青姑娘”，进入宫门后举竹棒威胁西施，情感复杂多变</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-013870c1938481d1558d4c2e439c83d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8283a4a379ab2b74495b2a64a83b7b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89960ee186e8b69358a7a5c384a3ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939cc8f0980bb7b81255939246f7fe66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb8a415d6907f0cafb86835c412854f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93cef7b7f368309937f9f274b9ad084</data>
