    <node id="范蠡">
      <data key="d0">范蠡</data>
      <data key="d1">人物</data>
      <data key="d2">范蠡, the historical figure associated with the state of Yue, is portrayed as an influential adviser and official who played a multifaceted role during a turbulent period in Chinese history. He is traditionally known to have served under King Goujian, where he not only received and showcased gifts but also provided critical counsel in statecraft, military strategy, and diplomacy. Accounts emphasize his involvement in matters ranging from the forging of swords for combat to commanding guards and orchestrating military operations, including leading troops against enemy strongholds. In addition to his strategic acumen, this version of 范蠡 is noted for his personal pursuits, such as his famed quest for the beauty Xi Shi and his support for figures like 阿青 through negotiation and direct command. Celebrated for his unconventional yet kind-hearted approach, he remains remembered as someone who balanced tactical brilliance with personal charm, leaving a lasting impact on Yue’s successes in both internal administration and external conflicts.

A distinct portrayal of 范蠡 emerges from records concerning the Chu region. This version of 范蠡 is described as a native of the Wan area in Chu, recognized for his unorthodox behavior and unconventional outlook. Known locally by the nickname “范疯子,” he served as a local official and was also depicted as a shepherd who recounted legendary Chu stories. His actions, which noticeably deviated from societal norms, earned him a reputation for being an individual with singular insights and a distinctive character. While sharing the same name, these contrasting accounts highlight separate interpretations of 范蠡’s legacy across different cultural and regional contexts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c6f4631a6bc7286dd9560f06b9845d9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-013870c1938481d1558d4c2e439c83d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8283a4a379ab2b74495b2a64a83b7b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89960ee186e8b69358a7a5c384a3ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42c3e318eb3b9f5e9c1bd450e13ff5b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3e590b3ab7f94ee3770d3739196401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939cc8f0980bb7b81255939246f7fe66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a72fd2ce03a23a58c65d98d2258f3e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b2a680eed881fd86d938031d895d21e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f36e0abe52b904e30fbb2a78b9a4a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb8a415d6907f0cafb86835c412854f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93cef7b7f368309937f9f274b9ad084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f20b87683fe0cc8608a321ff18feb71</data>
